      "id": "yizhu-d2e0f0c3e3c64973",
      "title": "酬乐天咏老见示",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "notes": [
        {
          "poemId": "yizhu-d2e0f0c3e3c64973",
          "code": "variant-review",
          "note": "底本作人谁不愿老、多炙、微霞；对照页作人谁不顾老、多灸、为霞。微霞亦见其他传本，暂不凭熟悉程度判错，选定统一定本时再处理。",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.gushiwen.cn/shiwenv.aspx?id=e07317133df0",
          "additionalSourceUrls": [
            "https://www.shidianguji.com/book/GJTS15/chapter/1lpdeetfa0ene"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
